        "id": 208175,
        "name": "seesome",
        "username": "seesome",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/seesome/{size}/2018_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-11-12T17:46:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"starkenburg_alexander\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/starkenburg_alexander/48/1857_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> starkenburg_alexander:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Note to those having difficulties: Twist the Ether + Unhallowed Halls is awesome. Just change all incoming hero damage to Radiant and it gets nulled. Set all villain self damage to infernal and its increased for free!</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Another note to those having difficulties: I had forgotten that in this particular challenge mode, ongoings attached to Spite will stay in play when he leaves and be automatically attached to Gloomweaver. So I could've won much faster if I had played my 2nd Twist the Ether on Spite early, rather than holding onto it for Gloomweaver.</p>",
